BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Heavy Boardgamers
UID:event_315446953@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260717T031759Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260717T230000
SUMMARY:Toronto Downtown Bi-Weekly Friday Night Gaming @ Wild Wings Bar & 
 Grill
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Heavy Boardgamers\nWelcome to the Friday Night Gaming 
 meetup for Toronto Heavy Boardgamers @ Wild Wings Bar & Grill!\n\nThe purp
 ose of this event is to meet up to play board and card games of all types\
 , from party / light games through to heavier / longer board games\, and h
 ave fun while doing it! Gamers of all levels of experience are welcome!\n\
 nYou are welcome to bring your own games to the event\, or join games host
 ed by others. The venue is looking to set up its own library soon\, so mor
 e options will be available then.\n\n**Scheduling details:**\n\n\\- If you
  have a specific game that you would like to post for\\\, feel free to do 
 so in comments\\.\n\n\\- If you would like to join a specific game that ha
 s already been posted\\\, feel free to comment on it confirming your parti
 cipation\\. Make sure you have noted the details posted by the host\\.\n\n
 \\- You are of course also welcome to organize / join games onsite on the 
 day itself\\\, assuming sufficient players / tables are available\n\n**Ava
 ilable Amenities:**\n\n\\- Food and drinks are available on\\-site\\. **Ou
 tside food and drinks are not allowed.**\n\n**Admission Fee:**\n\n\\- Ther
 e is a minimum spend /fee of $15\\.00 \\(\\+tax\\) charged by the establis
 hment for use of space\\. So if you purchase food and drinks for $15 or mo
 re\\\, you only have to pay for the food/drinks and there will be no table
  fee for you\\. However\\\, if you order nothing\\\, or less then $15\\\, 
 expect to be charged the minimum $15 spend limit\\.\n\n\\- Payments are to
  be made directly to the establishment during the event and not to the org
 anizer
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-heavy-boardgamers/events/3154
 46953/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260627T224908Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260627T224908Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto Heavy Boardgamers
UID:event_315455313@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260717T031759Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260718T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260718T180000
SUMMARY:Toronto Mid-Town Weekend Gaming @ The Guild House
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Heavy Boardgamers\nWelcome to the Saturday meetup for 
 Toronto Heavy Boardgamers @ The Guild House!\n\nThe purpose of this event 
 is to meet up to play heavier / longer board games\, and have fun while do
 ing it! We will start off small and if there is sufficient interest we wil
 l add capacity for future events.\n\nYou are welcome to bring your own gam
 es to the event\, or use the games in the library at the location.\n\n**Sc
 heduling details:**\n\\- If you have a specific game that you would like t
 o post for\\\, feel free to do so in comments\\. In your post\\\, include 
 the name of the game\\\, number of players needed for the game\\\, whether
  you are offering a teach or not\\\, and the start time \\(please try to s
 tart before noon if possible\\)\\.\n\\- If you would like to join a specif
 ic game that has already been posted\\\, feel free to comment on it confir
 ming your participation\\. Make sure you have noted the details posted by 
 the host\\.\n\\- You are of course also welcome to organize / join games o
 nsite on the day itself\\\, assuming sufficient players / tables are avail
 able\n\n**Rules around COVID:**\n\\- Given this is a public event\\\, we r
 espectfully ask that only i\\) fully vaccinated individuals\\\, and ii\\) 
 those not exhibiting any COVID symptoms\\\, participate\\. This requiremen
 t may change in the future based on provincial guidelines and group requir
 ements\n\n**Available Amenities:**\n\\- Food and drinks are available on\\
 -site\\\, you can see a detailed menu [here](https://theguildhouse.ca/page
 s/menu). **Outside food and drinks are not allowed by the Guild House.**\n
 \\- There is an on\\-site game library\\\, and use of it is covered within
  the admission fee\\.\n\n**Admission Fee:**\n\\- There is a $10 fee charge
 d by the establishment for use of space\\. Payments are to be made directl
 y to the establishment at the time of entry and not to the organizer
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-heavy-boardgamers/events/3154
 55313/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260628T150934Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260628T150934Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
